    "body": "It's a little bit unclear to me how `OffscreenCanvas`'s placeholder canvas element work. I think pixels can only be pushed to it and not pulled from it in which case there's no problem there (as `OffscreenCanvas`s own bitmap is always cleared when transferring). @junov is that correct?",
